    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81259" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιδῑν-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hover around</i>, prob. for sq. in <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				334
			</span></i> (anap.); <i>revolve round</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄξονας οὓς περιεδίνευον τροχοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					18.27
				</span></i>
			. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έω</span>, <i>whirl, wheel
			round</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύκλῳ αὑτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					3.167
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν κεφαλήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.Chr.
					1.56
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἥλιος π. περὶ αὐτὸν τὸν
				πόλον</span> Men.Rh.<i><span class="en">
				p.442S.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυφὼν π. τὴν ναῦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>VH</u>
					1.9
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>set in motion all round</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				1.39
			</span></i> :—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιδινήσασθε ἀνελίγματα χαίτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.485
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Diosc.
			</span></i>); also, <i>take a stroll</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιδινησόμεθα ἐν Λυκείῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Lex.</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be whirled round</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.145
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ti.Locr.
				97c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				5.20
			</span></i> ; <i>spin round</i>
			like a top, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				7.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Syr.D.</u>
				36
			</span></i>, etc.—Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιδονέω.</span></div>
